Change By:   Shivaram Venkataraman <https://sparkr.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=shivaram>

- A lot of configuration variables like spark.executor.memory are specified in spark-defaults.conf. We should read this during startup in SparkR to pick these up automatically -

Right now the only way to configure SparkR is to pass in arguments to sparkR.init. The goal is to add an API similar to SparkConf on Scala/Python to make configuration easier

